# ---- committee source material -------------------------------------------
# Not committed on purpose. Two reasons:
#
#  1. Several of these are partner-confidential — PwC's third-party co-branding
#     guidelines, HSBC's TMLA brand guidelines, MAS's branding guidelines. This
#     repo publishes to GitHub Pages, so committing them would put partner
#     internal documents on a public URL.
#  2. They are large (~130MB) and nothing here needs them at runtime. The
#     processed outputs are committed: assets/logos/, assets/photos/.
#
# Keep the originals locally and in Drive. tools/bake-partner-logos.py rebuilds
# the logos from them; tools/logo-sources/ holds the online-sourced fallbacks.
*.zip
Company Logos/
AvePoint Logo/
BlastOff! Website Update/
Blastoff Brand Deck.pdf

# Intermediate rasters from the logo bake, regenerated on every run.
tools/logo-render/
